m300333.物質界で共存していくことを選んだとはいえ、\n故郷を離れたデーモンたちには、\n:
Even though we chose to coexist in the material world,
for the demons who left their homeland,
they need a place to turn for comfort…

m920146.国家とはそういうものです。\n互いの国益が相反するものであれば敵対し、\n互いの:
That is simply how nations operate.
If their interests conflict, they become enemies;
if their interests align, they join hands.
